    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_admin_linked">Your data is tied to this admin. Medicines, reminders, and settings sync from their workspace.\n\n• Live updates need Realtime (DataBus) online.\n\n• Admin: %1$s</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_admin_not_linked">You are not linked to an admin yet. Without a link, Curax cannot load your care plan from the server.\n\n• Complete sign-up or sign-in and enter the admin connection code when asked.\n\n• Ask your clinic for their Curax connection code.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_ok">Everything needed for Curax is up.\n\n• API &amp; account: configured.\n\n• DataBus (Realtime): receiving live medicine and settings updates.\n\n• Alert relay: connected so push/relay alerts can arrive.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_partial">One path is up, the other is not — you may miss updates or alerts until both are green.\n\n• Realtime (DataBus): live WebSocket sync for medicines and admin edits.\n\n• Alert relay: the Connect button at the bottom — starts the relay service for FCM/relay delivery.\n\n• Fix: open this drawer, check Realtime and Alerts rows, then tap Connect if the relay is off.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_issues">Multiple checks failed — you may see stale data or no alerts.\n\n• Confirm server URL, bot id, and API key in User Settings.\n\n• Ensure you are linked to an admin.\n\n• Tap Connect for the relay; wait for Realtime to show Connected.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_config">Server URL or your device credentials are missing.\n\n• Open User Settings (toolbar menu) and set the central server URL if required.\n\n• Sign in again if your session was cleared.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_no_admin">Account is signed in but not linked to an admin workspace.\n\n• Link using the admin connection code during sign-up, or contact support to attach your account.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_health_offline">Realtime and relay are both down, but a past snapshot exists — you may see older data.\n\n• Open the app on a stable network.\n\n• Tap Connect to start the relay.\n\n• Realtime reconnects automatically when possible.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_alerts_active">Notifications are ready.\n\n• FCM token is registered and notification permission is granted (Android 13+).\n\n• You still need the relay connected for server-side alert delivery.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_alerts_inactive">Alerts are limited until this is active.\n\n• Grant notification permission when the system asks (Android 13+).\n\n• Tap Connect so the app can register FCM with the relay.\n\n• Check that battery optimization is not killing background work.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_realtime_connected">DataBus WebSocket is open.\n\n• Medicine list, reminders, and admin changes can sync in real time.\n\n• If data looks wrong, pull to refresh from Dashboard or reopen the app.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_realtime_reconnecting">The app is trying to reopen the DataBus connection.\n\n• Stay online; this usually resolves in a few seconds.\n\n• If it sticks, check network and that your admin has not revoked access.</string>
    <string name="user_sidebar_detail_realtime_disconnected">Live sync is off — you will not receive instant admin updates until this shows Connected.\n\n• DataBus starts automatically when you are linked and credentials are valid.\n\n• Try closing and reopening the drawer after a few seconds.</string>
